    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><verbatim>StopableWSGIServer is a TcpWSGIServer which run in a separated thread.
This allow to use tools like casperjs or selenium.

Server instance have an ``application_url`` attribute formatted with the
server host and port.
</verbatim> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
